* Exercises kind=octblock's xc_count>0 continuous-state contract (xc_charge_derivative/
* xc_charge_output_xc instead of the plain xc_charge). G1's analytic solution is
* xc(t) = 1 - exp(-t); in= is required by the netlist grammar even though the derivative/
* output_xc functions never read it.
SRC kind=const value=0
G1 kind=octblock path=doc-verify/octblock/xc function=xc_charge in=SRC xc_count=1
